      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement envelope encryption using a managed key service, I will use AWS KMS (Key Management Service) as the concrete external provider. This choice is based on its widespread use, robust security features, and comprehensive documentation. The code will include AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) to interact with AWS KMS, making the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
