        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `encrypt_payload.py` that encrypts a plaintext payload with a managed key using a concrete external provider, I will use the AWS KMS (Key Management Service) as the provider. This choice is based on the requirement to use a concrete external provider and the need to make the provider identifiable in the code. AWS KMS is a widely used service for key management and encryption. </thinking>\n",
